<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Oh, His Spirit fills, fills me now, fills me now!</l><l>Oh, His Spirit fills!</l><l>He drives out my sin, weakness, death, within,</l><l>To bear fruits of righteousness, holy to Him.</l><l>Oh, His Spirit fills, fills me now, fills me now!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
